SM-T715 tablet: the phone's modem pieces, on shannond's ModemManager facade.

Puts the mobile data tile back (the SS333 modem now works) and drives it
through NetworkManager's gsm connection, since omamobile-sit is the Pixel's
modem daemon: tile-state.sh probes nmcli (and shannonctl for the technology),
tile-action.sh brings the connection up or down. Against omarchy-mobile
5f7ba48, packages/omamobile-shell, on top of patches 0001-0004 (applied with
patch -p1 in that directory).

--- a/plugins/omamobile.quicksettings/TilesModel.js
+++ b/plugins/omamobile.quicksettings/TilesModel.js
@@ -12,13 +12,14 @@
